  "ruleText": "He-W 636.02 Verification of Identity. All financial assistance to needy families (FANF) applicants, including parents, caretaker relatives, and children, shall verify their identity, pursuant to He-W 606.28, as a condition of eligibility.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6531, INTERIM, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRES: 10-25-97; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #8452, eff 10-22-05; ss by #10471, eff 11-26-13; ss by #13663, eff 6-21-23",
